<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>G-Connect</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #fafafa; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .header { background-color: white; padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #dbdbdb; color: #262626; position: sticky; top: 0; }
        .feed { max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0 10px; }
        .post { background: white; border: 1px solid #dbdbdb; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .post-header { padding: 12px; font-weight: bold; display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .post-img { width: 100%; height: 300px; background-color: #efefef; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #8e8e8e; font-size: 18px; }
        .post-actions { padding: 12px; font-size: 22px; cursor: pointer; }
        .post-caption { padding: 0 12px 12px; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">G-Connect</div>

    <div class="feed">
        <div class="post">
            <div class="post-header">@gaurav_khobba</div>
            <div class="post-img">यहाँ आपकी पहली फोटो दिखेगी</div>
            <div class="post-actions" onclick="this.innerHTML='❤️ Liked!'">🤍 Like</div>
            <div class="post-caption"><b>gaurav_khobba</b> G-Connect पर मेरी पहली पोस्ट! #GConnect</div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

